      "uid": "zhcn:4a3daf479e26d6946d9107ed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟黄金城市一起进行训练时，\n她为了尽早跑出好成绩以得到周遭肯定，\n而不禁感到十分焦躁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9726b25c3ac7cb2cd30c3f3154de8c9472c7977f33ba7bb79bcfe8a68abfaf4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
