    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1307e77e4396ff613df15ea3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在这时她巧遇了玉藻十字。\n玉藻十字表示很欣赏黄金城市\n那旺盛又毫不隐藏的斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "179679e851a9c2d79e923baddc65f851962a4d0b8fb4f65a6969c0cb560c60fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1040/storytimeline_501040403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
