    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57fbd5723a3386b1c4a89be5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时她听闻玉藻十字受伤的消息便前去探视。\n虽然玉藻十字跑步时看起来很痛苦，\n但她对胜利的惊人执着仍丝毫不减。",
      "source_fingerprint": "380febc7e2907bb076e2bce7607b428fdfe7fa3180ab7eb8028b3db0b0eef24d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1040/storytimeline_501040404.json",
      "json_path": [
