    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afc5ba68218d80a36c47d019",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1040/storytimeline_501040405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9b640b2cd733d7704aaf8c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金城市向我吐露了她的想法。\n她发现自己原来一直是以回应或反抗周遭期待，\n来选择前进的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "add361780fde9c4cb7cbcfa41b7e1d22e58f81c9be292cb7784dcfb44b05e95e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1040/storytimeline_501040405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e67e4e310b697085c9d7c403",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1040/storytimeline_501040405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5560a4171641ac40e259cc2d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其实她从未依靠自身意志下过决定。\n她说，因为自己真的是个毫无内在的洋娃娃，\n才会回答不出自己为何而跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e65fe82a67d2b5c9c03ced06cb1fd26b1f66d572ebbf1836e7daf980714f9ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1040/storytimeline_501040405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f326d64d1326c989441cd2fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1040/storytimeline_501040405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46c299e1d4460284c27ad8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员告诉她，\n即使放弃跑步也并非逃避。\n但她还是无法将放弃跑步说出口。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb360816a83c581ed73df1b7666c12b6d7efa5bb89b788aac6354d95aaec543a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1040/storytimeline_501040405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bd72339a557e6cb979d8370",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1040/storytimeline_501040405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:908d3bda1012fa66c92c2b0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是训练员催促她去尽情跑步。\n黄金城市忘我地奔跑着。\n并且在全力奔驰后，她发现了一件事。",
