    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9a46b07b1cefed93242b21f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她说黄金城市的跑姿很“漂亮”。\n但黄金城市却表示，\n自己比较希望被说“很强”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae46cb8a0bbc78b9fcaae073eda5a414bf45a2314eecf9f090acc726ca81c92b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
