      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而雪之美人却坚定地表示，\n“漂亮”一词并非仅仅形容外表，\n还包含了“强大”跟“厉害”等所有称赞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64364189ffd92dfe6cd753fd39156f8452b91c34dc4930fe8a14c6db49d68582",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
